This project is available for educational and personal use.

These are the terms the project has always stated in its README; this file
exists so they sit where tooling and contributors look for them. If you want
Slotronome under a standard open-source licence instead — MIT, Apache-2.0 or
similar — that is a decision for the copyright holder, and this file should be
replaced with the full text of whichever is chosen.


Bundled fonts
-------------

The typefaces in fonts/ are not covered by the terms above. Both are licensed
under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, and each ships with its full
licence text:

  Press Start 2P    Copyright 2012 The Press Start 2P Project Authors
                    fonts/PressStart2P-OFL.txt

  Silkscreen        Copyright 2001 The Silkscreen Project Authors
                    fonts/Silkscreen-OFL.txt

The OFL permits redistribution of the fonts, bundled with software, provided
the licence and copyright notice accompany them — which is why those files are
included. The fonts are not sold on their own and have not been modified.


